Vale styles

The Microsoft writing style package used by `npm run lint:prose` is NOT
committed here — .gitignore excludes .vale/styles/Microsoft, and `vale sync`
downloads it from https://github.com/errata-ai/Microsoft (MIT) on demand. Only
this project's own rules (.vale/styles/Docs/) are in the tree.
